    {
      "target": "외부 손님은 여기서 기다려 주세요.",
      "reading": "Oebu sonnimeun yeogiseo gidaryeo juseyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "External visitors, please wait here.",
        "ko": "외부 손님은 여기서 기다려 주세요.",
        "ipa": "Oebu sonnimeun yeogiseo gidaryeo juseyo.",
        "ar": "يرجى أن ينتظر الزوار الخارجيون هنا.",
        "cs": "Externí návštěvníci, prosím, počkejte zde.",
        "da": "Eksterne besøgende, vent venligst her.",
        "de": "Externe Besucher, bitte warten Sie hier.",
